    dcterms:description "Tracks identity verification, income verification, program-specific qualification criteria, and active enrollment status for community service participants. Qualification verification is the formal determination layer sitting between eligibility screening and active benefit delivery — it catches identity mismatches, income discrepancies, and program-specific rules (residency duration, asset limits, household composition) that screening tools miss. Output at [964:968] feeds the Workflow Completion Monitor." ;
